  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="215d530e-2af9-5479-a97e-3395d7223e33" activityNameId="8851fa79-7ba4-59ba-b2c6-888fcb8b3bf7" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Photovoltaic laminate, CdTe, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Photovoltaic laminate, CdTe, at plant
Production of photovoltaic thin film modules by vapour deposition.  The modules produced at First Solar have a size of 1.2m by 0.6 m. The weight is 16.7kg/m2. The average efficiency in 2011 is 11.7%. The rated nominal power is about 84Wp per module.;
Synonyms: Solarmodul, PV-module, cadmium telluride, thin film; 
UUID: a297818e-fff7-3406-9b8a-51ce69db19cb
Electricity including overhead operations and office use, materials, transport of materials, infrastructure. Module processing includes film deposition, etching, cleaning and module assembly. Process emissions not known (except Cd).
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Production technology of thin film cells. Sublimation of the powders and condensation of the vapours on a glass substrate by vapour transport deposition (VTD).
Time period: Data refer to production in 2010
Production volume: 2'304'505 m2 in 2010
Sampling: Producer information 
Extrapolations: Waste disposal from factory approximated with data for crystalline modules. The quantity of several small material uses (about 700 items) has been summarized for some main materials.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a297818e-fff7-3406-9b8a-51ce69db19cb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
